00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Each VM is torn down and restored from its snapshot, its GPU reset and reattached.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:44.000
Every GPU back 3.5 s after the click, as the coordinator measured it.

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:47.000
Cut. Clip 3 of 3, recorded 68 minutes before clip 1: one VM opened and restarted.

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:59.000
